			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-03T08:20:42Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1496,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Modularize SCM and TreeView command surfaces\n\nDecompose the monolithic `SourceControlManagement.rs` and `TreeView.rs` command handlers into discrete modules, aligning with the project's strict file-per-command naming convention. The previous implementation bundled all Tauri command logic into single files with extensive inline documentation, violating the separation of concerns required for the growing IPC layer.\n\nKey modifications:\n- **SourceControlManagement.rs**: Replaced 260-line file with a module manifest exporting 7 stub modules (`GetAllSourceControlManagementState`, `ExecuteSCMCommand`, etc.). Retained high-level architectural docs while moving implementation details to dedicated files.\n- **TreeView.rs**: Replaced 302-line file with a module manifest exporting 8 stub modules (`GetTreeViewChildren`, `RefreshTreeView`, etc.). Preserved references to `TreeViewProvider` trait integration points.\n- **Keybinding.rs**: Refactored documentation comments to strictly adhere to the `Command::Function` naming pattern and fix formatting inconsistencies.\n\nThis structural change enables independent development of specific IPC commands, facilitates granular testing, and prevents symbol shadowing issues as the codebase scales. The modular approach mirrors the recent refactorings in `PublishNotification` and `CommandProvider` modules, ensuring consistency across the Mountain binary initialization path.",
			"SHA": "96e824c731d69abcf06c33c53bb3e17f19b3c8e8"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-03T08:20:30Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1496,
				14
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Introduce modular DevLog subsystem with OTLP tracing\n\nReplace ad-hoc logging in the IPC layer with a dedicated `DevLog` subsystem under `Source/IPC/DevLog/`. This module provides tag-gated console output, file sink mirroring, and fire-and-forget OTLP span exporting.\n\nKey components include:\n- `IsEnabled`/`IsShort`: Tag resolution logic supporting `Trace=all`, `Trace=short`, and specific tag lists.\n- `WriteToFile`: Lazy-initialized file sink writing to `~/Library/Application Support/land.editor.*.mountain/logs/<timestamp>/Mountain.dev.log`.\n- `AliasPath`: Replaces verbose Tauri app-data paths with `$APP` for readability in short mode.\n- `DedupState`/`FlushDedup`: Consecutive duplicate suppression to reduce log noise.\n- `EmitOTLPSpan`: Async HTTP POST implementation for OpenTelemetry data.\n- `IsBenignEnoent`: Filter for known-optional probe paths (VS Code/Copilot artifacts) to downgrade errors to debug logs.\n\nThe implementation follows strict PascalCase naming and explicit `::Fn()` qualification patterns, ensuring zero runtime cost in release builds via `cfg!(debug_assertions)` gating. The new `dev_log!` and `otel_span!` macros provide a unified interface for developers to instrument IPC handlers and boot sequences.",
			"SHA": "746075e9cc8ee101c809bb67f2628006eb4fa52b"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-03T08:20:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1481,
				6
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Enforce explicit function qualification in IPC command handlers\n\nUpdate Tauri command handlers in `Source/Binary/IPC/` to replace direct module function calls with the explicit `::Fn()` qualification pattern (e.g., `mountain_get_cache_stats::mountain_get_cache_stats`). Apply the same pattern to struct initialization (`CollaborationPermissions::Struct`), aligning with the project's ongoing modularization effort and strict PascalCase naming conventions.\n\nThis change prevents potential symbol shadowing issues within the `IPC::AdvancedFeatures` and `IPC::StatusReporter` modules, ensuring consistent symbol resolution across the binary initialization and command handling architecture. It maintains architectural consistency with recent refactorings in `PublishNotification`, `CommandProvider`, and `Entry` modules.",
			"SHA": "48e24ab9d9d18b8f3ccbbf499a200d00346671c3"
		},
