			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Enforce explicit function qualification in PublishNotification\n\nUpdate `Source/Vine/Client/PublishNotification.rs` to replace the direct call `DevLog::NowNano()` with the explicit `DevLog::NowNano::Fn()` pattern. This change aligns the notification timestamp generation with the project's ongoing modularization effort and strict PascalCase naming conventions, ensuring consistent symbol resolution and preventing potential shadowing issues within the `DevLog` module.\n\nThis adjustment maintains architectural consistency with recent refactorings across `CommandProvider`, `StorageProvider`, and `EnhancedIPC` modules.",
